   "t": " is \"of course\", with ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "nagiyev",
   "t": "же",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " leaning on it for emphasis. Then comes ",
